---
permalink: /schedule/program/
layout: layouts/base.njk
entry:
  path: /schedule/program/
  title: Archived program
  bodyClasses: "page neve elementor-default elementor-kit-4"
---
<main id="content" class="neve-main" tabindex="-1">
<section class="archive-program">
<h1>2022 Events Program</h1>
<p>The DLF Forum and affiliated events took place October 9–13, 2022. This archived program includes {{ program.sessions.length }} sessions. All times are Eastern Daylight Time (UTC−4).</p>
<p class="archive-program-downloads"><a href="/schedule/">Back to the events schedule</a> · <a href="/schedule/program.json" download>Download program data (JSON)</a> · <a href="{{ program.source | escape }}">View the original Sched program</a></p>
<nav aria-label="Program days"><ul>{% for day in program.days %}<li><a href="#day-{{ day.date }}">{{ day.label | escape }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul></nav>
{% for day in program.days %}
<section aria-labelledby="day-{{ day.date }}">
<h2 id="day-{{ day.date }}">{{ day.label | escape }}, 2022</h2>
{% for session in day.sessions %}
<details id="session-{{ session.id | escape }}">
<summary>{{ session.time | escape }} — {{ session.title | escape }}</summary>
<p class="session-meta">{{ session.timeAndPlace | escape }}{% if session.type %}<br>{{ session.type | escape }}{% endif %}</p>
{% if session.speakers.length %}<p><strong>Speakers:</strong> {{ session.speakers | join(", ") | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
<div class="session-description">{{ session.descriptionHtml | safe }}</div>
<p><a href="{{ session.url | escape }}">View {{ session.title | escape }} on Sched</a></p>
</details>
{% endfor %}
</section>
{% endfor %}
</section>
</main>
